    <item>
      <title>°❀⋆࿔ ? *:･ Giraffes villagers in ACNL °❀⋆࿔ ? *:･</title>
      <author>cl43tilde</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/711482</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/711482#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f1150dde7a9ed501315134f56c600eaafebf30b9</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 23:47:25 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a936cb9dfe9a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a936d37abd98.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a936d43d9e2a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a936d4974f78.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hii guys!! I'm on this villager-mods streak recently, and i'm loving it! I've so much more planned, and other cool stuff, that target other aspects of the game, so stay tuned ;)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;°❀⋆࿔ ? *:･&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img src="https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/a/a5/Spr_b_5b_492_s.png"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src="https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/0/07/Spr_5b_203_f.png" alt="Female"&gt;°❀⋆࿔ ? *:･&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Well... After a lot of trouble on blender, as always, I was almost ready to abandon my idea of integrating a fully functional giraffe villager in the game. But I didn't give up and found the alternate 3D model of Gracie from ACHHD on the "Model Ressource" (my holy-graal in terms of acnl modding btw). So here is my little baby!! A cute little giraffe, heavily inspired by Gracie, since Gracie is a "relatively" realistic giraffe. In the sense that her color palette matches a giraffe's usual one. And since I have a big preference for semi-realistic villagers in the game, I had no choice but to keep some elements from her model. But I fully redesigned her face and expressions, to give her a more likable face, and not her usual r-b-f. Her name is Gianna (or Gia in the italian version I think... Cause Annalisa's name in that version wasn't long enough for me to put "Gianna").&lt;br&gt;So as I said before it replaces another anteater (yeahhhh, the worst villagers ;)), Annalisa!</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/giraffes_in_new_leaf.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <category>Villagers</category>
      <category>Skins</category>
    </item>
