t) But the maximum shade I believe will be ok is shade 12, which is the &lt;b&gt;3rd darkest shade in the game.&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This face mod is an override. Meaning that it will replace the item that is already in the game. &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Look at the photo inside of the mod to find the face that you need to use for this mod.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;(Luma &amp;amp; Citra compatible)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Colors:&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;(Candyland, Pink) &amp;amp; (Dreamscene, Blue).&lt;/b&gt; Only download&lt;b&gt; ONE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2F_nAMf5Xobys&amp;amp;follow=true"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Video tutorial now available!) For a written version, use the tutorial inside the zipped folder if you need help on how to install.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;All I ask is that you download this mod for free personal use &lt;b&gt;ONLY&lt;/b&gt;, NOT commercial. &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Do not repost, resell, re-edit, claim ownership, or place behind a paywall.)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;[&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Under Creative Commons License]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Please credit me by linking my mods if you ever use them for screenshots or for your mods.)&lt;br&gt;------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Also, A Note &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;When I was posting mods, I didn't really think of it much. My first three with just basic edits and I just brushed it off like it wasn't gonna go anywhere after that but I was wrong. I received SO much more positivity than I realized. The amount of love, support and kind words from so many people was shocking to say the least and damn are they a lot of you guys.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I didn't expect so many likes, downloads and overall cool people to actually care for what I do and my stuff. I met so many awesome folks here and the modding community is super vibrant right now. Again, thank you SO much to everybody who has liked and supported my work. I hope you all still enjoy my stuff and that we can do more in the future &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&amp;lt;33333&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maybe I'll try to go for 100? 150? 200? is that even possible? idek but imma try anyways!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Again, thank you for shopping at my boutique! Stay glamorous.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;-Mikii&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;P.S: sorry for the copy paste lol</description>
