ol people to actually care for what I do and my stuff. I met so many awesome folks here and the modding community is super vibrant right now. Again, thank you SO much to everybody who has liked and supported my work. I hope you all still enjoy my stuff and that we can do more in the future &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&amp;lt;33333&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maybe I'll try to go for 100? 150? 200? is that even possible? idek but imma try anyways!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Again, thank you for shopping at my boutique! Stay glamorous.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;-Mikii&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;CREDITS! The Purple Tracen Academy Uniform is made by &lt;b&gt;UsagiDahlia&lt;/b&gt;, all credits go to them. &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/660931"&gt;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
