      <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 17:52:50 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a8c84420461c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a8c84415da72.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a8c85457a140.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a4d647b96a4a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a4d648193d17.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Shaymin in New Leaf&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Change&lt;/em&gt;: A whole new 3d model, that works just like a regular villager's one&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Change&lt;/em&gt;: Brand new textures&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hi guys, welcome to my page!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;I have been a devoted pokemon fan for ages now, and my favorite pokemon has always been Shaymin. I've alwayssss dreamt of integrating that charcter into acnl, but couldn't find a mod - at least, one that was downloadable (cause some exist, but only as concepts). So here's my little "dream" come true &lt;33&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod replaces the villager "Annabelle" (ant03.bcres), and works on both Citra and Luma (3ds).It also replaces Annabelle's house exterior by a new-customized one &lt;33.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;	Since Shaymin is a hedgedog, I had to use one of the few models available in the game, and unfortunately I wasn't able to make the clothes more "villager-like". The apron is therefore still "visible" even though it is covered by a pink gingham pattern, that you, unfortunately, cannot change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;NB : &lt;/u&gt;This mod wouldn't be available without the help of the lovely &lt;b&gt;@Kikifrommeadow&lt;/b&gt; who helped a lot to through that process. So shout out to her &lt;33</description>
